<text x="292" y="300" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="12"><tspan x="292" dy="0">-p silently routed to API</tspan><tspan x="292" dy="17">billing for some users &#8212; even</tspan><tspan x="292" dy="17">with no API key set.</tspan></text>
